# libfacedetection

Source: https://github.com/ShiqiYu/libfacedetection

Imported commit: 3023e1289e3b85311632bcfd45c9895b4292778b

License: 3-clause BSD, see `LICENSE`.

Scope:

- Only the minimum `src/facedetectcnn*` implementation is imported.
- The full upstream repository, examples, Rust crate, mobile samples and
  Highway backend are intentionally not vendored.
- This project uses the original C++ CNN path as a board-test candidate for
  YuNet/libfacedetection face detection.
